# Salesforce AI Tool — Business Requirements

## 1. Document Purpose

This document defines the business requirements for the **Salesforce Enterprise AI Tool & Customer Service Assistant**.

The solution enables Salesforce customer-service users to use natural language to retrieve information, analyze Cases, search enterprise knowledge, receive AI recommendations, and perform approved business actions.

---

# 2. Business Background

Customer-service teams typically spend significant time reviewing Salesforce records, searching Knowledge Articles, analyzing customer history, and preparing responses.

The AI Tool provides a centralized assistant within Salesforce that combines:

- Salesforce CRM data
- Generative AI
- AI tools
- RAG
- Enterprise knowledge
- External APIs
- Salesforce automation

The objective is to improve agent productivity while maintaining Salesforce security, governance, auditability, and human oversight.

---

# 3. Business Problem

Current customer-service processes may require agents to manually:

1. Open a Case.
2. Read the complete Case history.
3. Review customer information.
4. Search previous Cases.
5. Search Knowledge Articles.
6. Check order information.
7. Determine Case priority.
8. Draft a customer response.
9. Decide whether escalation is required.
10. Update Salesforce records.

This creates:

- Longer Case resolution time.
- Increased manual effort.
- Inconsistent Case classification.
- Inconsistent customer responses.
- Difficulty finding relevant knowledge.
- Excessive context switching.
- Increased operational cost.

---

# 4. Business Objectives

## BR-001 — Reduce Agent Effort

Provide an AI assistant that reduces repetitive manual activities.

## BR-002 — Improve Case Resolution

Provide relevant Case summaries, customer history, Knowledge Articles, and recommendations.

## BR-003 — Improve Response Quality

Generate context-aware response drafts that agents can review before sending.

## BR-004 — Improve Case Classification

Provide AI recommendations for:

- Category
- Subcategory
- Priority
- Sentiment
- Routing

## BR-005 — Improve Knowledge Discovery

Automatically retrieve relevant enterprise Knowledge Articles.

## BR-006 — Maintain Security

Ensure AI operations respect Salesforce permissions and enterprise security policies.

## BR-007 — Maintain Human Oversight

Prevent high-impact business actions from occurring without appropriate authorization or confirmation.

## BR-008 — Provide Auditability

Maintain sufficient records to understand:

- What the user requested.
- Which AI tool was selected.
- What data was accessed.
- What recommendation was produced.
- What action was executed.

