# 14. Example Business Scenario

### Input

```text
Customer:
I have tried to make my payment three times and
it still fails. I already contacted support twice.
```

### Expected AI Processing

```text
Analyze Case
     ↓
Analyze Sentiment
     ↓
Classify Issue
     ↓
Retrieve Customer History
     ↓
Search Knowledge
     ↓
Recommend Action
     ↓
Generate Response
```

### Expected Recommendation

```text
Category: Payment
Priority: High
Sentiment: Negative
Escalation: Recommended
Knowledge: Payment Processing Troubleshooting
```

The agent reviews the recommendation before any Case update.

