# 15. Acceptance Criteria

## AC-001

Given an authorized user has opened a Case,

when the user asks for a Case summary,

then the AI Tool shall return a summary based on accessible Case information.

## AC-002

Given a Case contains customer communication,

when sentiment analysis is requested,

then the system shall return an appropriate sentiment classification.

## AC-003

Given relevant Knowledge exists,

when the user requests recommendations,

then the system shall return relevant approved Knowledge Articles.

## AC-004

Given a user requests an unauthorized operation,

then the system shall prevent the operation.

## AC-005

Given the AI recommends a Case update,

then the system shall not automatically perform the update unless the configured authorization policy permits it.

## AC-006

Given an external API fails,

then the system shall return a controlled error and record the failure for monitoring.

